## Pass: all of these hold

- Each marked test drives the mock through its real interface and asserts
  the capability as this harness documents and recorded it, specifically
  enough to fail if the mock behaved otherwise.
- Together they cover every condition, value, limit and failure path the doc
  sections and runs show for this harness (e.g. a default, the value that
  disables it, what is and is not written).
- What the tests assert agrees with the docs and the recorded runs.

